ugh the Deluge campaign, face off an army by yourself or hold the line alongside your comrades.\n•🦿Push beyond human limits with experimental cybernetic augmentations never meant for the average soldier.. Become powerful enough to claim the mettle of a legendary HERO yourself!!\n\n🏅The Empire rewards those who endure:\n\n+50% XP & Tokens on weekends\nPremium: -5% XP Requirement.","path":"/game/7410285033-the-zombie-s-revenge","slug":"7410285033-the-zombie-s-revenge","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/a65b9389b32ee88c5c04ea73854fbd8331c5a26a52a2a0529675c75c172869dd.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-08c27926602a89495d5bbaf8c5c68eeb/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":0,"visitor":3188473,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2026-07-05T03:04:05.664Z","creator":{"name":"31 Gaming","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":2,"freeCount":2,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}}],"totalGames":14204,"totalPages":592,"currentPage":372}